Zermelo.pdf
-----------
E. Zermelo, 1929
Die Berechnung der Turnier-Ergebnisse als ein
Maximumproblem der Wahrscheinlichkeitsrechnung
(First paper on the subject later known as Bradley-Terry model)


Hunter.pdf
----------
David R. Hunter, 2004
MM Algorithms for Generalized Bradley-Terry Models
(Important paper on minorization-maximization algorithms)


Newman.pdf
----------
M. E. J. Newman, 2023
Efficient Computation of Rankings from Pairwise Comparisons
(Describes an efficient and robust form of Zermelo's ranking
algorithm, which is used in our project)
